---
source: crates/platitude-core/src/highlight/tree/tests.rs
description: "Each sample line (`|`) over the role of each of its characters: c comment, k keyword, t type, f function, s string, n constant, a annotation, blank plain."
---
| # A comment.
  cccccccccccc
| %YAML 1.2
  aaaaaaaaa
| ---
| name: sample
        ssssss
| quoted: "double"
          ssssssss
| single: 'single'
          ssssssss
| count: 42
         nn
| ratio: 1.5
         nnn
| enabled: true
           nnnn
| nothing: null
           nnnn
| tilde: ~
         n
| list:
|   - one
      sss
|   - two
      sss
| map: { a: 1, b: two }
            n     sss
| anchor: &base
|   key: value
         sssss
| alias: *base
| tagged: !custom value
          ttttttt sssss
| block: |
|   literal text
  ssssssssssssss
| folded: >
|   folded text
  sssssssssssss
| ...
